                            <comment id="16479389" author="ascherbakov" created="Thu, 17 May 2018 17:02:57 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=agoncharuk&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;agoncharuk&quot;&gt;agoncharuk&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I think this is expected behavior, because kernal is not fully started yet.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Instead I&apos;ve changed control.sh utility so it now will run task on the same node as it was connected to (--host).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Previously a task was forwarded to random node and could happen to arrive on joining.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
